        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The thrill of spiking in volleyball. Why don't you try it out?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by an indie developer who loves volleyball!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sports game made after numerous trial and error to contain the appeal of volleyball!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Try out various volleyball strategies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quicks, pipes, open attacks, and fast tempo attacks in a 3v3 volleyball match!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve your greatest spike in diverse scenarios in your screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Immersive gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the immersion of actually playing on the court yourself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by controlling only 1 player on the court from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Appealing storyline!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the attractive characters that appear in the universe of The Spike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Siwoo with his journey in both volleyball and inner growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Diverse volleyball contents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is normal volleyball boring for you? Enjoy different types of volleyball</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >contents such as tournament, colosseum, beach volleyball, and more.</p>",
